This repository holds only tastr-sorceress's own code. The container image built from it
also installs the following third-party software, each under its own terms:

- yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp): The Unlicense.
- yt-dlp-ejs (https://github.com/yt-dlp/ejs), installed with yt-dlp[default]: The Unlicense;
  its bundled JavaScript dependencies are under the MIT and ISC licences.
- deno (https://github.com/denoland/deno), the JavaScript runtime yt-dlp uses for YouTube,
  installed from the `deno` package on PyPI: MIT License.

yt-dlp[default] also pulls in its usual helper libraries (among them requests, urllib3,
certifi, brotli, websockets, pycryptodomex and mutagen), and the image is based on the
official python:3.12-slim image (Debian and CPython). Their licences ship inside the image
with each package.
